{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A story, a wish</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everything seems just ordinary</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But fulfilling a wish always comes with a price</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yet we enjoy dreaming dreams that we don't want to awaken from in our daily lives</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But this time'I' hope to bring 'you' home</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The visual novel [\u9972\u517b\u67d3\u768430DAYS] will bring an ordinary story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4045190/extras/a6b49f274f2e993cf8718450f5575cc8.avif?t=1774654560\" width=1024 height=478 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to your play and valuable feedback.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u300eGame Introduction\u300f</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every day, tormented by illness, you encounter her in an alley.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She says her name is RaN, and she wants to spend a few days in your home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For some reason, you agree to her request.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You know that 30 days is long for her, yet also very short.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sometimes you wish this was just a dream.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sometimes you wish this was something truly real.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What is real? What is fake?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Does it really... matter?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you really have to make a &quot;choice&quot;?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u300eCharacter\u300f</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4045190/extras/7b2057c1045b6b401919a5a826bc7263.avif?t=1774654560\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4045190/extras_big/7b2057c1045b6b401919a5a826bc7263.avif?t=1774654560 width=1560 height=1560 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u67d3 RaN</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Preferences: Milk</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dislikes: Bright lights, Canned fish</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;How are you?&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Transformed from a kitten into a human</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The peculiarities about her go unnoticed by othersShe seems to know everything about you; </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >she always hopes you can live a more normal life</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >30 days is a long time for her</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She has waited for you for too long...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4045190/extras/4f8d6395b679fac5221cb150ad8056e5.avif?t=1774654560\" width=1280 height=1280 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u5854\u65af TARS</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A companion who calls themselves 'pointer'</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Only appears after DAY 20</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She will bring you more chances to rewrite the ending</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u300eHave you really forgotten me?\u300f</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u300eEven RaN have forgotten me??\u300f</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Staff List:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Character Art/UI Artist: \u8d64\u6a59chio</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Voice Actor CV (RaN/TARS): \u606a\u8bc0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Copywriting/Programming: XiAoRaN_Channel</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Public Assets CC0/CC-BY:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u7518\u8336\u306e\u97f3\u697d\u5de5\u623f(Music)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u307f\u3093\u3061\u308a\u3048 (Backgrounds)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u6c38\u8fdc\u7684\u7a7a\u4e4b\u5973\u738b (Bubble UI)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Renpy Official Demo (Paper UI)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u82b1\u95f4\u8389\u841d (Code Reference)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sincere thanks to all the creators ww</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A few notes:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As an independent game, there are still many shortcomings in this visual novel, and the sparse CG images and illustrations will be followed up later.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As an independent game, this game follows the CC0/CC-BY license, and the sources of the materials have been credited within the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Special thanks to the character illustrator ChiOrange and the Bilibili uploader HuanJianLiLuo, as well as Ren'Py tutorials from the forever Queen of the Sky.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thanks also to all members who participated in the game testing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thank you for playing this work.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0Sincerely,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >XiAoRaN</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"\u559d\u725b\u5976\u5f53\u7136\u66f4\u91cd\u8981","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4045190/4c4f8d2c90944f942a65c4b2000dfe392a82ae2d.jpg"},{"name":"\u4e0d\u518d\u56de\u5fc6\u75db\u82e6","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4045190/0b76695f4b6ff575e3d8ddcd4b0bf81c242a8a8c.jpg"},{"name":"\u5982\u68a6\u65b9\u9192","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4045190/0bce687c5740db4a7fe8f6429a0b2ed35638765e.jpg"},{"name":"\u597d\u5427...\u597d\u5427...","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4045190/d9b4c81ee50be57e3c95f7fc62aa53